| `src/cljc/dao/postgraphics/terminal.cljc` | Source Code | +118 | -72 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljc/dao/gui/event.cljc` | Source Code | +71 | -33 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljs/datomworld/demo/artifact.cljs` | Source Code | +49 | -37 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljd/dao/postgraphics/flutter.cljd` | Source Code | +49 | -28 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljd/datomworld/demo/artifact.cljd` | Source Code | +48 | -27 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljs/dao/postgraphics/web.cljs` | Source Code | +41 | -14 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljd/datomworld/demo/postgraphics.cljd` | Source Code | +4 | -5 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljc/datomworld/demo/earth_moon_runner.cljc` | Source Code | +3 | -5 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljc/datomworld/demo/voxel_runner.cljc` | Source Code | +3 | -5 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljd/datomworld/demo/dao_gui.cljd` | Source Code | +3 | -5 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljd/datomworld/demo/solar_system.cljd` | Source Code | +3 | -5 | `Medium` |\n| `src/cljs/datomworld/demo/solar_system.cljs` | Source Code | +3 | -5 | `Medium` |\n| `test/dao/gui/event/bind_test.cljc` | Tests | +213 | -119 | `Low` |\n| `test/dao/postgraphics/terminal_test.cljc` | Tests | +172 | -54 | `Low` |\n| `docs/design/dao.gui.event.md` | Documentation | +53 | -29 | `Low` |\n| `docs/design/dao.postgraphics.terminal.md` | Documentation | +57 | -10 | `Low` |\n| `test/dao/postgraphics/web_test.cljs` | Tests | +55 | -12 | `Low` |\n\n## Reviewer Focus & Recommendations\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
